# 27ART10AKPL, LG's StanbyME (27" Full HD, touch screen, tunerless) as a UK set, on the global
# N21D webOS 6 firmware, kisscurl-kluane 04.44.16. The
# models DB lists this OTA ID only on StanbyMEs: the Korean 27ART10AKPL/CKPL/CMPL/DKPL/DQPL/DSPL
# and the UK 27ART10AKPL.AEKW, .AEUW and .AVSW; no US set, so the UK model (the one EU country
# digit) is the board.
# Values from this firmware's own tables (27ART10AKPL with
# countryType=EU panelResolution=FHD ddrSize=2G graphicResolution=1920x1080):
# hwopt: digit 0 2, hw-option-gen's countryType EU (nyx-option-gen DVB); digit 3 1, FHD; digit 11
# 4, DDR 2 GB; digit 14 2, the 1920x1080 graphic plane; every other digit hw-option-gen's 0.
# modelopt: digit 8 1, tv.hw.supportNMRM, as configd's tooltype/ART10 layer marks the series
# (com.webos.app.home's supportNMRM); msc reads its accelerometer only with it. Every other digit 0.
# ToolOpt: this firmware's LLS default record (libmodelOpt, toolOpt5 98829367) with toolOpt1's panelInch 4 ("27")
# and toolType 24 ("ART10": configd's tooltype/ART10 layer). countryGrp 4: configd's GBR RMM
# grpCode. chip LM21UA0: boot.pak's. No "tunerless MODEL_NMRM": this firmware's U-Boot has no
# MODEL_NMRM token to append. emmc_size: LM21A's (no LM21U value exists). MAC and serial are
# placeholders, replaced by the VM's own identity at launch.
ethaddr=a8:23:fe:12:34:56
devtmpfs.mount=1
modelopt=000000001
hwopt=200100000004002000
ToolOpt=772:22:79872:64:98829367:271633672
debugMode=3
modelName=27ART10AKPL
serialNum=000RAXX00001
countryGrp=4
chip=LM21UA0
tvregion=DVB
emmc_size=0x1d1fff000
cmdEnd
